Usage:
    ixdiff [flags] <old> <new>

Arguments:
    old    path to the baseline binary
    new    path to the changed binary

Flags:
        --fn string        diff the function with this name or substring (repeatable) (repeated)
        --filter string    limit the summary to functions containing this substring, ~regexp (repeatable) (repeated)
        --top int          number of functions to list in ranking tables (default 100)
        --sort string      ranking order for tables: size, insts, or name (default "size")
        --state string     limit tables to functions in this state: changed, added, or removed (repeatable) (repeated)
        --mask-sp          ignore stack-offset shifts caused by frame size changes
        --json             emit machine-readable JSON instead of text
        --side-by-side     show function diffs as two columns
        --blocks           match basic blocks before diffing, tolerating block reordering
        --all              follow the summary with a diff of every function in the ranking table
        --color string     colorize diffs: auto, always, or never (default "auto")

Global flags:
    -h, --help         prints help for the command
        --advanced     when used with -h, prints advanced flags help
